editor_description = "The bakehouse oven (tools/build/prop_abbey_stores.py): a rubble box 2.4 x 2.3 m and 2.4 m high, its arched mouth on the -Z side, two iron leaves swung back beside it, a peel stood against it, a flue drawn in above it to the wall behind (+Z). Inside is a vaulted chamber he can crawl into, modelled to be seen from within. The hidden Blocks are its collision."

